<p>You have learned to focus your blows to hit your target, granting <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+40, +57, +72, +86, +100</acronym> accuracy and allowing you to attack creatures you cannot see without penalty for the next <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 5, 5, 6</acronym> turns.</p>